ess kit. Original pixels, colors, transparency, and aspect ratio are retained. It represents the distribution platform; DRM-free availability does not imply public game source.","language","en","获取方式","暂不可访问","access","section","源码","Platform listing is not game source — DRM-free describes distribution restrictions, not whether complete source or reusable assets are available.","service","演示",[83],{"_61":84,"_25":85,"_86":87},"浏览 GOG 游戏","https://www.gog.com/en/games","note","Desktop game catalog. Check the individual product and system requirements rather than assuming browser play.","教程",[90],{"_61":91,"_25":92,"_86":93},"向 GOG 提交游戏","https://www.gog.com/submit-your-game","Official submission page with an embedded developer form. Catalog inclusion requires a separate publishing decision.","来源核查","2026-10-20","verified","metadata","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[104,105],"dimensions","2D","3D","开发阶段",[109],"stages","构建与发布","主题",[113,114,115],"tags","游戏发布","游戏发现","桌面游戏","延伸阅读",[118,119],{"_61":84,"_25":85},{"_61":91,"_25":120},"https://lp.gog.com/submit-your-game/en","项目源码",[123],{"_61":121,"_25":92},"用途与特点","GOG 是提供无 DRM 版本与可选桌面客户端的精选数字游戏商店。开发者可通过官方表单提交作品，但提交不代表获准收录或立即上架。应分别核对每款游戏支持的操作系统、版本与发行状态。无 DRM 发行并不等于公开游戏源码。","detail","guidance","资源类型","社区","分类","游戏制作","category","lead","summary","name","production","community",[155,156],{"_145":146,"_147":148,"_32":149},[144],[142,143],"2d","3d","ship","tutorial",{"_61":154,"_25":92,"_17":80,"_86":93},"demo",{"_61":153,"_25":85,"_17":80,"_86":87},{"_61":150,"_17":151,"_86":152},"Platform listing is not game source","unavailable","DRM-free describes distribution restrictions, not whether complete source or reusable assets are available.","Browse games on GOG","Submit a game to GOG",{"_61":153,"_25":85},{"_61":154,"_25":120},{"_158":159},"documents",{"_73":160,"_35":161},[163,167,168,169,166,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,165,202,1